{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","浮空辉刃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤飞剑攻击敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休召唤6把飞剑，接下来的普通攻击会控制这些飞剑攻击敌人，每把飞剑造成70% + 9% ATK伤害，持续8秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":42,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至75% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至80% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至85% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每把飞剑伤害提升至90% + 9% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":17,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","重力坍塌"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌人施加重力使其倒地，并引爆目标身上的剑魂。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休使用普通攻击发射飞剑命中敌人时，会在敌人身上留下剑魂，休每进行4次普通攻击，下一次普通攻击会改为对持有剑魂最多的敌人释放“重力坍塌”，造成200% + 30% ATK伤害并使其倒地2秒，同时引爆敌人身上的所有剑魂，每道剑魂对该敌人额外附加36% + 3% ATK伤害。在“浮空辉刃”生效期间，“重力坍塌”的范围扩展至周围1格，并且会额外发射飞剑，造成6次48% + 6% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":181,"end":186,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":120,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":178,"end":190,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至220% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至52% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至240% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至56% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“重力坍塌”伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK，“浮空辉刃”状态下每段伤害提升至60% + 6% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":42,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","淬火力场"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","布置力场强化飞剑。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，休在自身周围布置“淬火力场”，力场存在时，自身提升48点远程防御。休释放的飞剑穿过力场后将会获得强化，附带敌人最大生命值1.3% + 0.2%的真实伤害（最高不超过14% + 2% ATK）。力场会在自身位置变化后消失，并在自身位置连续不变3秒后重新生成。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":77,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":88,"end":100,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.4% + 0.2%，最高不超过16% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.5% + 0.2%，最高不超过18% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","附加伤害提升至目标最大生命值的1.6% + 0.2%，最高不超过20% + 2% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提升攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提高33点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","授勋仪式"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身获得友军施加的非永久属性提升时会获得能量和穿透，并提升双方的攻击速度。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，休立刻回复300点能量，并永久提高4点穿透，此外还会使双方攻击速度均永久提升16点，该效果每名友军至多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至6点。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该效果触发2次后，休额外提升15%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","休获得的穿透提高至8点。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","休对高生命值比例的敌人造成更高伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","休在面对强力的敌人时能展现高昂的骑士精神，对当前生命值比例高于50%的敌人造成的伤害提升25%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","誓约之手"]]}